    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;People You May Know?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Thursday night, and Ritsu has just returned from work.<br>Today was the day\u2014Ritsu finally got a smartphone.<br>While getting used to the new screen, a familiar name appeared: a close friend from school<i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/0ae66e2cd656b164a522b219a83fa201.poster.avif?t=1753784659\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/0ae66e2cd656b164a522b219a83fa201.apng?t=1753784659\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/d23e40c9456dbdfce46fc983fc125def.webp?t=1753784659\" width=650 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weekend story that begins with a single message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chat choices, caf\u00e9 orders, map navigation, and other apps added one by one,<br>this freshly bought smartphone becomes a companion for reconnecting,<br>bringing color to the moments spent together again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel where you navigate apps to meet up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/34c4b33789e2a2dbfcd5781392261485.avif?t=1753784659\" width=640 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/68a7059cd06353a9d261465467aa7694.webp?t=1753784659\" width=650 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that simple suggestion\u2014&quot;People You May Know?&quot;\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/2ffa029b2d0aaab040680a8dbee6e32f.avif?t=1753784659\" width=640 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritsu gathers the courage to message Saku on Thursday night.<br>Surprised, nostalgic, and a little nervous,<br>they begin a weekend of meet-ups, from Friday to Sunday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The table you choose, the drinks you order, and each small conversation\u2014<br>every detail gently brings old memories back to life.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;People You May Know?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Thursday night, and Ritsu has just returned from work.<br>Today was the day\u2014Ritsu finally got a smartphone.<br>While getting used to the new screen, a familiar name appeared: a close friend from school<i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/0ae66e2cd656b164a522b219a83fa201.poster.avif?t=1753784659\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/0ae66e2cd656b164a522b219a83fa201.apng?t=1753784659\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/d23e40c9456dbdfce46fc983fc125def.webp?t=1753784659\" width=650 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weekend story that begins with a single message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chat choices, caf\u00e9 orders, map navigation, and other apps added one by one,<br>this freshly bought smartphone becomes a companion for reconnecting,<br>bringing color to the moments spent together again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel where you navigate apps to meet up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/34c4b33789e2a2dbfcd5781392261485.avif?t=1753784659\" width=640 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/68a7059cd06353a9d261465467aa7694.webp?t=1753784659\" width=650 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that simple suggestion\u2014&quot;People You May Know?&quot;\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/2ffa029b2d0aaab040680a8dbee6e32f.avif?t=1753784659\" width=640 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritsu gathers the courage to message Saku on Thursday night.<br>Surprised, nostalgic, and a little nervous,<br>they begin a weekend of meet-ups, from Friday to Sunday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The table you choose, the drinks you order, and each small conversation\u2014<br>every detail gently brings old memories back to life.</p>",
